(21323,1244,'NPCMission02','','呵呵呵呵～知道本小姐的厲害了吧！呵呵呵呵～～','server_implementation/data/extracted_csvz/Data2/Patch/Comm/NPCMission02.csv',246,'客戶端文字資料',0),
(21324,1245,'NPCMission02','','我一定會把我會的全部傳授給你！（眼睛閃閃發光中）','server_implementation/data/extracted_csvz/Data2/Patch/Comm/NPCMission02.csv',247,'客戶端文字資料',0),
