(21506,1427,'NPCMission02','','我．．．我的火尖．．．槍．．．','server_implementation/data/extracted_csvz/Data2/Patch/Comm/NPCMission02.csv',429,'客戶端文字資料',0),
(21507,1428,'NPCMission02','','哈哈哈哈！想跟我打？死八婆跟你的手下再去練一練吧！','server_implementation/data/extracted_csvz/Data2/Patch/Comm/NPCMission02.csv',430,'客戶端文字資料',0),
