(22841,2763,'NPCMission03','','帶出來的兄弟都死光了．．．這下子我怎麼敢回去交差．．．不如另外再找個沒人的山頭占地為王吧．．．嘿嘿嘿嘿．．．．．．','server_implementation/data/extracted_csvz/Data2/Patch/Comm/NPCMission03.csv',765,'客戶端文字資料',0),
(22842,2764,'NPCMission03','','饒．．．饒．．．饒命啊！','server_implementation/data/extracted_csvz/Data2/Patch/Comm/NPCMission03.csv',766,'客戶端文字資料',0),
