(23557,3479,'NPCMission04','','嘿嘿．．．咯！．．．那．．．咯！．．．那又如何．．．咯！．．．在這裡．．．老子最大．．．咯！．．．嘿嘿嘿嘿．．．咯！．．．','server_implementation/data/extracted_csvz/Data2/Patch/Comm/NPCMission04.csv',481,'客戶端文字資料',0),
