(24566,4488,'NPCMission05','','你這小鬼．．．得了個宜還賣乖！\n．．．好．．．好．．．你就等著瞧吧！','server_implementation/data/extracted_csvz/Data2/Patch/Comm/NPCMission05.csv',490,'客戶端文字資料',0),
