(24573,4495,'NPCMission05','','我．．．我剛剛腦袋．．．一片空白．．．只覺得．．．好餓．．．好想吃些什麼．．．\n．．．我覺得．．．我．．．很不正常．．．','server_implementation/data/extracted_csvz/Data2/Patch/Comm/NPCMission05.csv',497,'客戶端文字資料',0),
(24574,4496,'NPCMission05','','．．．是．．．不過．．．肚子還是．．．好餓．．．','server_implementation/data/extracted_csvz/Data2/Patch/Comm/NPCMission05.csv',498,'客戶端文字資料',0),
