(26786,6723,'NPCMission07','','廟公要你幫忙收集東西，你趕快啟程吧！','server_implementation/data/extracted_csvz/Data2/Patch/Comm/NPCMission07.csv',725,'客戶端文字資料',0),
(26787,6724,'NPCMission07','','你趕快把發簪拿給盈盈姑娘吧！別讓她久等了。','server_implementation/data/extracted_csvz/Data2/Patch/Comm/NPCMission07.csv',726,'客戶端文字資料',0),
(26788,6725,'NPCMission07','','你趕快把糖果拿給小雄吧！我怕他又開始哭鬧了。','server_implementation/data/extracted_csvz/Data2/Patch/Comm/NPCMission07.csv',727,'客戶端文字資料',0),
(26789,6726,'NPCMission07','','真是感謝你的幫忙，請你趕快把糖果拿給他吧！','server_implementation/data/extracted_csvz/Data2/Patch/Comm/NPCMission07.csv',728,'客戶端文字資料',0),
