(29159,9097,'NpcMission10','','嘿嘿，噓～不要吵。\n我在等著捉弄某人呢～嘻嘻～','server_implementation/data/extracted_csvz/Data2/Patch/Comm/NpcMission10.csv',99,'客戶端文字資料',0),
(29160,9098,'NpcMission10','','嘿嘿～你太慢啦～你太慢啦！\n這次是你輸了！沒什麼話好說了吧！\n哈哈哈哈～','server_implementation/data/extracted_csvz/Data2/Patch/Comm/NpcMission10.csv',100,'客戶端文字資料',0),
(29161,9099,'NpcMission10','','嘿嘿～你還是太慢啦～太慢啦！\n這次又是你輸了！沒什麼話好說了吧！\n哈哈哈哈～','server_implementation/data/extracted_csvz/Data2/Patch/Comm/NpcMission10.csv',101,'客戶端文字資料',0),
(29162,9100,'NpcMission10','','咦咦！！你???你怎麼現在會在這裡？\n糟???糟糕了！','server_implementation/data/extracted_csvz/Data2/Patch/Comm/NpcMission10.csv',102,'客戶端文字資料',0),
